{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Pixel Merge Balls is a fast-paced arcade game where your mission is simple: move, match, and merge colorful balls before time runs out. Easy to pick up, hard to master \u2014 and even harder to stop playing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tQuick and snappy gameplay \u2013 perfect for coffee breaks or score-chasing marathons.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tRetro pixel art style with an upbeat soundtrack that sticks in your head.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tIncreasing challenge \u2013 the longer you play, the more intense it gets.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tEndless scoring potential \u2013 how long can you keep merging before it all falls apart?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love casual games with a retro twist, Super Pixel Merge Balls delivers instant fun with arcade spirit. Simple to learn, hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901080/extras/bb2e217293fc042e065978f0bd2b2667.poster.avif?t=1748263529\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901080/extras/bb2e217293fc042e065978f0bd2b2667.apng?t=1748263529\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2901080/c724af48f92ee6ea702d3f6fa68804e719c341a3.jpg"},{"name":"Fine Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2901080/d3d6d80b19f7c199c3de2335681a8003ea278fc1.jpg"},{"name":"You should make some friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2901080/b490ea4e954a49d00a86d9b6ef10d379f9651f92.jpg"},{"name